Cosine similarity ranges from –1 to 1, but for sentence embeddings you usually see:

Cosine value	Meaning
0.90 – 1.00	Almost identical meaning
0.75 – 0.90	Very strongly related
0.60 – 0.75	Related / same topic
0.40 – 0.60	Loosely related
< 0.40	Different topics